 ENDF/B-VI MOD 5 Revision, June 2000, S.C. Frankle, R.C. Reedy,   2425 1451
                           P.G. Young (LANL)                      2425 1451
                                                                  2425 1451
 The secondary gamma-ray spectrum for radiative capture (MF 12,   2425 1451
 MT 102) has been updated for new experimental data at incident   2425 1451
 neutron energies up to 1 keV.                                    2425 1451
 The previous (MOD 4) pure continuum at thermal neutron energy    2425 1451
 is replaced by 71 discrete photons.                              2425 1451
 The MF=12, MT=102 yields from 1-100 keV were adjusted slightly   2425 1451
 to force energy conservation.                                    2425 1451
 Details of these changes are described in Frankel et al. [Fr01]. 2425 1451
